Origin
------

PTMProphet-rs is a Rust translation of PTMProphet and supporting classes from
the Trans-Proteomic Pipeline (TPP) release 6.3.2
(https://svn.code.sf.net/p/sashimi/code/tags/release_6-3-2). It uses the
upstream files below. Each entry gives the file's path in that release, its
copyright line as written in the file, and the PTMProphet-rs files that derive
from it. Entries marked [precautionary] contribute only numeric constants or a
few numeric details, and are listed so that no attribution is missing.

  src/Validation/PTMProphetParser/PTMProphetParser.cpp
      Copyright (C) 2011 David Shteynberg
      PTMProphet-rs: src/config.rs, src/pipeline.rs, src/em/train.rs,
      src/pepxml/index.rs, src/pepxml/psm.rs, src/pepxml/roc.rs,
      src/pepxml/writer.rs

