Changes
-------

In June 2026 the University of Michigan translated the files above into Rust
and restructured them as PTMProphet-rs. PTMProphet-rs has been modified since;
the git history records each change.


Affiliation
-----------

PTMProphet-rs is an independent Rust port of PTMProphet, part of the
Trans-Proteomic Pipeline from the Institute for Systems Biology; it is not
affiliated with or endorsed by ISB or the TPP developers. PTMProphet is the
work of David Shteynberg et al.


